    "body": "At the retained Context candidate, all 504 unsuccessful canonical entry targets require Generate, yet complete replies remain8/512. Add and execute one opt-in coordinated pass over the existing shared Generate unary/pair factors, driven by a fresh gradient at that separately authenticated Context checkpoint.\n\nEvery trial changes all incident Generate atoms simultaneously and preserves pooled winners across the84 successful actual-prefix positions, including EOS. Exact sparse cache updates apply at an unchanged clipping reference; otherwise the authoritative full Generate/physical-Copy reducer runs. Revision-bound batch validation precedes all commits. Shared logical incidence uses the existing directed finite-H4 algebra and ordered edges. Bias/prototype masters, upstream operators and U numeric values stay fixed; export rebinds metadata and independently checks all protected scores, masses and winners.\n\nThe single finite58560-coordinate construction accepts2798 moves and records55762 saturated original-gradient proposals, with zero rejected moves. Native combined CE decreases8.971047852627056→8.52634374894637. Full own-feedback replies remain8/512, original8retained, zero gained/lost; correctentry8/512 and complete source-swap pairs4/256. The candidate is optimization evidence; the original accepted model remains accepted. No usefulchat, held-out transfer, geometry-advantage or energy result is claimed. Another unchanged coefficient dose/order/seed is not justified.\n\nValidation at executed3952de49e6bf7a97721a5dec6ec3080231ec7b6a: changed formatting,5integer cache tests,1core incidence test,41CUDA fitter tests and release build PASS (0failures/ignored); mathematical/adversarial exact-source reviews PASS. Corrected independent reader verifies1024own-prefix rows,588objective terms,84full protected pools, frozen/changed masters and all256swappairs. Actual Rust complete-file BLAKE3 verification passes on run/Context/originalparent/donor/plan. The initial zero-test cache filter and reader pair_id assumption are preserved defects, repaired without model rerun. Final exact-head checks/review are being posted separately before queueing.\n\nExecuted binary SHA2561154003b46961c66d3fe927d310220abc5e12af424ea8a1346aa8b6034b21752; configuration5888251aaf1dfb7a19b117791d5188612b2124a1c8aa1a5f6d7873f2a0fef68a. Full result/audits/logs/checkpoints preserved at private HF revision52abd5e497894cb00d88dea77bbdcca509be1b03 prefix codex/sol-emission/emission-0001-3952de49e6,81,166,494-byte archive SHA2560ef2a476a40349fb6152154996a125aac5bf5da9a8beaef19c7ec12e43ae7ff3; both archive+manifest freshdownload/hashPASS. Runtime preserved separately at38b827ae59d626572d1407581f68775ef5b5acda. Producer451.717s, supervisor461.564s, peakRSS2032492KiB, sampledGPU1965MiB; cumulative projection375270→411270s, prior charges retained, no laptop build/model/large downloads. Structured source/artifact/cost/result receipt and conditional prototype-neighborhood dependency are included in current state and docs/evidence.\n\nReferences #820. Work card: https://github.com/UOR-Foundation/uor-r4/issues/820#issuecomment-6056464516\n",
